    "text": "By MLive Express Desk ,\n9 hours ago OTTAWA COUNTY, MI -- A detailed human resources report revealed Ottawa County is losing a significant portion of its new hires before they reach the one-year mark. Interim Human Resources Director Sarah Allen delivered an annual presentation covering county staffing and employee benefits to the Ottawa County Board of Commissioners on Tuesday, Aug. 25. Read full article\n1",
